  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵欢迎来到提示词工程的迷人世界，在这里，AI 驱动的图像创作力量推动着创造力的边界。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "今天，我们将深入探讨 Microsoft 的 Image Creator 如何以各种艺术风格将你的图像创作带入生活。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不是艺术专家，但通过研究图像生成学到了很多关于艺术风格的知识。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是定义整体图像风格的提示词的第一部分。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "生成的图像可能无法完全代表艺术风格；它只是生成的参考。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不是艺术专家，以下类别仅基于我的个人偏好。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示词：Time-worn and weathered Prehistoric Cave Painting Of A Llama",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "仅使用史前洞穴绘画无法生成清晰的图像。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "添加像 time-worn 和 weathered 这样的关键字可以大大改善图像。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示词工程的艺术 - 艺术风格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
